  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">中世纪建筑宇宙随着这个末地新版本而扩展。探索五个令人印象深刻的中世纪风格新建筑，它们可能会出现在末地的奇幻岛屿上。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你喜欢冒险，这个选项非常适合你，因为所有建筑都充满了宝藏，当然还有陷阱和敌人。你一定会爱上这个维度的体验！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">别忘了下载中世纪建筑的主版本！<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">点击这里！</span></a></strong><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">下界维度的版本也已推出！<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings-nether-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">点击这里！</span></a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要和朋友一起玩的服务器吗？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在寻找服务器来和朋友玩任何模组或整合包，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a>就是你的解决方案！他们提供性价比最高的Minecraft服务器，点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此链接</strong></a>并使用优惠码\"Lupin\"可享受25%折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本模组为末地维度添加了五个新建筑，全部采用中世纪风格，能完美融入你的游戏。最棒的是，它与绝大多数修改末地生成的模组完全兼容！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你是建筑、美丽景观或复古风格的爱好者，这个模组可能非常适合你的游戏。把它加入整合包，享受全新的末地建筑生成吧！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">所有建筑由以下作者设计：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/emberunholy/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">emberunholy</a>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>是否兼容其他添加建筑的模组？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">毫无疑问，它与任何其他模组（包括建筑和生物群系模组）都完美兼容。不过对于后者，新建筑只会出现在与初始设定特征相似的生物群系中。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>新建筑会在哪里生成？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">仅在末地维度中，在击败末影龙后可以进入的岛屿上。它们会随机生成并遵循特定参数，避免出现过于频繁。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>支持服务器吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！完全支持！记住，与朋友玩模组的最佳方式就是使用BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>点击此链接可享25%折扣</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个模组可以用于整合包吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然！只要仅在Modrinth或CurseForge平台发布。上传到其他任何平台都将侵犯我们的权利，完全不被允许。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果你考虑将它加入你的Modrinth或CurseForge整合包，我们将非常感激。如需任何小调整或有疑问，请联系我们！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以录制这个模组的视频并在频道展示吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然，你可以在频道自由游玩这个模组或我们的任何整合包并制作视频，事实上，我们会非常感激！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/710/medieval-buildings.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/712/medieval-buildings-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/713/medieval-buildings-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/714/medieval-buildings-7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/716/medieval-buildings-8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>",
